一◆◆yī◆数§§§one△一百公斤¦one hundred kilograms△一本书¦a book△两万一¦twenty-one thousand△五分之一¦one-fifth△第一¦first△我去过那儿一两次。¦I have been there once or twice.▷形§§§same△我们坐一趟车。¦We rode on the same bus/train.△咱们是一家人。¦We are of the same family.▷形§§§whole; all; throughout△他吃了满满一碗饭。¦He ate a full bowl of rice.△他一身油泥。¦He was covered all over with grime.△她一路哭到了家。¦She cried the whole way home.△我一天都不在家。¦I won't be home all day.▷形§§§concentrated; whole-hearted; pure△一色毛¦pure wool▷代§§§each△一人一只苹果¦one apple for each△一日三餐¦three meals a day△一小时八十公里¦80 kilometres per hour▷代§§§certain△某一天¦a certain day△一天晚上¦one night▷代§§§another△乌贼一名墨斗鱼。¦Another name for cuttlefish is inkfish. / The cuttlefish is also/otherwise known as inkfish.▷副§§§[used before a verb or an adjective, indicating the suddenness or thoroughness of an action or a change in the situation]△大吃一惊¦be startled△使劲一推¦give (sb) a hard push△眼前一黑¦cannot see things all of a sudden▷副§§§once; as soon as△大学一毕业就结婚¦get married as soon as one leaves university△他一合眼就睡着了。¦No sooner had he closed his eyes than he fell asleep.△这你一学就会。¦You can learn it in no time at all.△他们一看苗头不对拔腿就溜了。¦They fled at the first hint of trouble.△她一听到他的名字就发抖。¦She quivered at the mention of his name.▷副§§§[used in the middle of a reduplicated verb meaning a little, slightly]△看一看¦have a look△笑一笑¦give a smile△坐下来想一想¦sit down and think a bit
一◆◆yī◆名§音乐§§yi [note of the scale in gongchepu (工尺谱), corresponding to 7 in numbered musical notation]
一下◆◆yīxià◆副§§§[used after a verb as its complement, indicating an act or an attempt] one time; once△看一下¦have a look△试一下¦have a try△睡一下¦have a little sleep△使劲拉一下绳子¦give a strong pull at the rope△瞎猜一下¦make/have/take a wild guess▷副§§§in a short while; all at once; all of a sudden△等一下¦just a minute/moment; wait a minute/moment△他被一下解除了所有职务。¦He was summarily stripped off all his official titles.△他一下裁去了半数雇员。¦He sacked half of his employees at one sweep.△天一下阴了下来。¦It became overcast all of a sudden.△最低工资将一下提高20%。¦The minimum wage would be raised by 20% at a stroke.
一举◆◆yījǔ◆名§§§one action; one stroke; one fell swoop△成败在此一举。¦Success or failure hinges on this one action.▷副§§§at one swoop/stroke/blow△一举成功¦be an overnight success△一举歼灭来犯之敌¦wipe out the enemy in one fell swoop△他一举闻名全国。¦He skyrocketed to national prominence. / He rose to national fame overnight.△他在选举中一举获胜。¦He swept to victory in the elections.
一些◆◆yīxiē◆量§§§a number of; some; a few; a little△一些国家¦some countries△做一些适当调整¦make certain appropriate adjustments△每个盘子里都盛一些。¦Just put a little on each plate.△就这一些了，将就着用吧。¦These few are all we have, and you may as well make do with them.▷量§§§more than one kind; certain△他担任过一些重要职务。¦He had held certain important positions.△有一些问题还没搞清楚。¦Some problems still remain to be cleared up.▷副§§§[placed after an adjective, indicating a slight change in degree]△请走慢一些。¦Please walk more slowly.
