一家◆◆yījiā◆名§§§one family△军民一家。¦The army and the people are of one family.▷名§§§one school/doctrine
一家人◆◆yījiārén◆名§§§all of the same family; one family△一家人不说两家话。¦People of the same family/Close friends don't need to stand on ceremony.△我们是一家人。¦We are of the same family.
一成不变◆◆yīchéng-bùbiàn◆§§熟§invariable; unalterable△人的思想并不是一成不变的。¦People's ideas are not fixed and unchangeable.△世界上没有一成不变的东西。¦Nothing in the world is immutable.
一方面◆◆yīfāngmiàn◆名§§§one side; one aspect△这只是事情的一方面。¦This is only one side of the matter.▷名§§§for one thing ..., for another thing ...; on (the) one hand ..., on the other hand△他一方面很想见她，另一方面又怕见她。¦On the one hand he was eager to see her, but on the other he was afraid of seeing her.△我不能去——一方面，我没有钱；另一方面，我工作脱不开身。¦I can't go—for one thing I have no money, and for another I am too busy with my work.
一旦◆◆yīdàn◆名§§§single day; very short time△毁于一旦¦be destroyed in one day△溃于一旦¦collapse overnight▷连§§§once; in case; now that△一旦时机成熟¦once the time is ripe△一旦制订了计划，你就应按计划行事。¦Once the plan is all set, you should keep to it.△机会一旦错过，永远不会再来。¦Once an opportunity slips away, it is gone for good.
一晃◆◆yīhuǎng◆动§§§pass in a flash△窗外有个人影，一晃就不见了。¦A figure flashed past the window.
