一致◆◆yīzhì◆形§§§identical; unanimous; consistent; coincident△强求一致¦coerce uniformity△取得一致¦achieve harmony; reach consensus (on)△步调一致¦march in step; act in unison△观点一致¦hold identical views; be of the same view; be united in opinion△目标一致¦be united in one's aims△前后不一致¦be inconsistent△言行一致¦one's words match his deeds△意见一致¦be in agreement on sth△意见不一致¦do not coincide in opinion; be in disagreement (on)△主谓一致¦subject-verb agreement△双方根本利益是一致的。¦The fundamental interests of both parties coincide. / Both sides share the same fundamental interests.△我们的看法一致。¦Our views converge.△这论点前后不一致。¦The points of the argument do not hang together well. / This point of view lacks consistency and coherence.△我们要解放思想，实事求是，团结一致向前看。¦We must emancipate our minds, seek truth from facts and unite as one in looking forward.▷副§§§together△一致通过决议¦adopt a resolution unanimously△一致同意¦agree unanimously; reach unanimity; reach a consensus△一致行动¦take consistent action△举国上下一致努力。¦The whole nation is working together with one mind.
一般◆◆yībān◆形§§§same as; just like△钢铁一般的意志¦iron will△哥俩一般高。¦The two brothers are of the same height.▷形§§§one kind△别有一般滋味¦have some indescribable taste▷形§§§general; ordinary; common△一般情况¦ordinary circumstances△一般做法¦common practice△一般用途货车¦general-purpose lorry△收成一般¦average harvest△从个别概括一般¦generalize from particulars△从一般到具体¦from generalities to particulars△一般来说，西安的天气不错。¦Generally speaking, the weather in Xi'an is not bad.△他的工作很一般，谈不上出色。¦His work is only mediocre, certainly not distinguished.△她打牌水平一般。¦Her card playing skills are so so.△我是泛指一般的学生。¦I am speaking of students in general.
一起◆◆yīqǐ◆副§§§in the same place, group, etc△一起住¦live in the same room/place△把破碎的花瓶拼在一起¦piece together a broken vase△他们是一起的。¦They belong to the same group.▷副§§§together; in company△大家不要一起发言，一个一个讲。¦Don't talk all at once. Speak one by one.△铃一起响起来。¦The bells rang out together.△他的父母一起点头。¦His parents nodded in unison.△有人看见他和一个女孩在一起。¦He had been spotted in a girl's company.△反腐败要坚持“老虎”、“苍蝇”一起打。¦To tackle corruption, the Party must crack down on the 'flies' at the bottom and the 'tigers' higher up.△与使你快乐的人一起生活，而不是与你所取悦的人。¦Spend life with who makes you happy, not who you have to impress.▷副§§方§altogether; in all△这几件东西一起多少钱？¦How much is that altogether?
