下◆◆xià◆名§§§low position or rank△床/枕头/桌子下¦under a bed/pillow/table△地毯/垫子下¦be underneath the cushion/carpet△地表之下¦beneath the surface of the earth△零下10度¦ten degrees below zero△海平面下400米¦400 metres below sea level△从桥下通过¦pass beneath a bridge△放在显微镜下¦put under a microscope△坐在树下¦sit beneath/under a tree△上无片瓦，下无插针之地¦have neither a tile over one's head nor a speck of land under one's feet△上有老，下有小¦have both parents and children to support△上至市长下至市民¦from the mayor down to the ordinary citizen△在山脚下¦at the foot of a mountain△胳膊下夹着文件¦hold some papers under one's arm△结果/摘要如下。¦The result/excerpt is as follows.△地板在脚下咯吱咯吱作响。¦The boards creaked beneath the feet.△上有政策，下有对策。¦Those below can always devise counter-measures against any policy from above.▷形§§§positioned below one or more similar things; of the bottom part of sth; lower△下嘴唇¦lower lip▷形§§§of a later time; being immediately next in a sequence; next△搭下班车¦take the next bus△看下一场比赛¦watch the upcoming/next match△在下一个转弯处向右拐¦take the next turn on the right△下段行程¦next lap of the journey△下个星期/季节/世纪¦next week/season/century△下任总统¦next President△下一章/一站¦next chapter/stop△下下周¦the week after next△下一位是谁？¦Who's next, please?△下一步需要做的是找所房子。¦The next step is to find a house.△你的文章将刊登在下一期。¦Your article will appear/be published in the next issue.▷形§§§lower/inferior (in rank, position, class, quality, etc)△分为上、中、下三等¦be divided into three grades: the upper, the middle and the lower▷名§§§[used to indicate the circumstance, extent, situation, etc]△在疾病威胁下¦under the threat of disease△在非常困难的情况下¦under very difficult conditions; in a tough situation△在法西斯统治下¦under the rule of fascism△在交警的帮助下¦with the help of the traffic policemen△在联合国的支持下¦under the auspices of the United Nations△在目前情况下¦under present conditions△在专家组的领导下¦under the leadership of the expert group△在压力下¦under pressure▷名§§§[used after numerals, indicating position or direction]△他把头摆出去，四下里看了看。¦He poked his head out and took a look all around.△他们两下里都反对。¦Both of them opposed it.▷名§§§[used to indicate a certain time or season]▷副§§§down; downwards
下◆◆xià◆动§§§be less than△受伤者不下五十人。¦There were no less than fifty wounded.△我一个月读的书不下十本。¦I read more than ten books in a month.▷动§§§come/go down; descend; alight; get down△下车¦get out of a car; alight from a car△下床¦get out of bed△下飞机/火车/公共汽车¦get off a plane/train/bus△下河游泳¦go down to the river for a swim△下楼¦go/come downstairs△下马/自行车¦get off a horse/bicycle; dismount from a horse/bicycle△下山¦go/come down a mountain△下树¦descend from a tree△下梯子¦climb down a ladder; descend a ladder△列车停靠在了一个小站，没人上下。¦The train stopped at a small station. No one got on or off.△谁先下？¦Who is going down first?▷动§§§go or come down to (usu from a more northerly or westerly place, the upper reach of a river, a higher position, etc)△下车间¦go down to a workshop△下厨房¦go into the kitchen to do cooking△下地窖¦descend into a cellar△下地狱¦go down to hell△下馆子¦go and eat in a restaurant△下基层¦go to the grass roots△下矿井¦go down a mine△下连队当兵¦(of officers) go to the companies to serve in the ranks△下乡度假¦go to the country for a holiday△南下广州¦go down to Guangzhou△顺流而下¦sail/go downstream▷动§§§issue; deliver; send△下调令¦issue an order of transfer△下命令¦issue orders△下聘书¦send a letter of appointment△下请帖¦send an invitation△下挑战书¦issue a letter of challenge△下通知¦send out notices△下指令¦give directions△下逐客令¦show sb the door△下最后通牒¦issue the ultimatum▷动§§§leave (the stage, field, etc); exit△下高速路¦go or come off an expressway△下火线¦retreat/come back from the front△下舞台¦make one's exit from the stage△哈姆雷特下。¦Exit Hamlet.△客队要求换人: 3号上，7号下。¦The visiting team asks for substitution, No. 3 for No. 7.△演出结束后从后门下。¦After the performance, please exit from the back door.▷动§§§stop; get/leave off (work)△下夜班¦come off the night shift▷动§§§(of rain, snow, etc) come down; fall△下霜。¦There is frost.△下雾。¦There is a fog. / A fog has come on.△毛毛雨下个不停。¦A fine drizzle keeps falling.△雨下了一夜。¦Rain fell all night.▷动§§§apply; begin to use△下刀¦get/stick a knife into sth△下力气¦exert oneself; put forth strength; make an effort▷动§§§put into; cast△下面条¦cook noodles; put noodles into boiling water△下肥料¦apply fertilizer△下棺¦lower the coffin into the grave△下网¦cast a net△下种¦sow a field with seeds△下佐料¦put in condiments▷动§§§play (a board game)△下盘棋¦have a game of chess▷动§§§take down/off; dismantle; unload△把门下下来¦take down the door△下窗帘¦take the curtain off△下俘虏的枪¦disarm the captive△下货¦unload the cargo▷动§§§(of animals) give birth to; drop a litter; lay (eggs)△下了一头小牛¦give birth to a calf△一个刚下的蛋¦newly laid egg△这头母猪要下崽了。¦The sow is about to litter.▷动§§§give (a definition); draw (a conclusion); form (an opinion); make (a judgement, decision, etc)△下保证¦make a pledge△下定义¦define; formulate/work out/set down/frame/give a definition△下结论¦conclude; draw a conclusion; arrive at/come to a conclusion△下决心¦make up one's mind (to do sth); be determined (to do sth)△下判断¦form an opinion; pass a judgement△下批语¦submit/make remarks in writing▷动§§§capture; take△连下数城¦capture several cities in succession▷动§§§give in; yield△双方相持不下。¦Neither side would give in.
下◆◆xià◆量§§方§[used to indicate the amount of something in a container]△瓶子里只有半下油。¦The bottle is half full of oil.▷量§§§[used after 两 or 几, indicating one's ability or skill]△真有两下子¦have special ability/knack/skill (for)△他就这么几下子。¦That's all he can do.▷量§§§[used to indicate the repetition of an action]△摆了下手¦wave one's hand△打了他几下¦hit him a couple of times△看了一下¦have a look△掴了他几下¦give him two or three slaps△猛击一下头部¦strike a heavy blow to the head△推了一下¦give sb a push△鸣了三下喇叭¦give three blasts on the horn△拍了一下肩膀¦give sb a pat on the shoulder△打扫一下房间¦give the room a clean△甩了一下尾巴¦give a swish of its tail△山上突然亮了一下。¦There was a sudden flash on the hill.△钟敲了三下。¦The clock struck three times.
下◆◆xia◆动§§§[indicating a movement from the higher place to the lower]△把头低下¦hang one's head; lower one's head△放下¦put sth down△跳下¦jump down▷动§§§[indicating completion or result of an action]△打下基础¦lay a foundation△打下粮食¦harvest grain△定下题目¦decide on a topic△记下电话号码¦put down a telephone number△留下姓名¦write down sb's name△买下一栋楼¦buy a building△惹下麻烦¦run/get into trouble△收下礼物¦accept a gift△脱下鞋¦take off one's shoes△拍下这个场面。¦Shoot this scene.▷动§§§[indicating space or capacity]△这个桶装得下50升。¦This barrel contains 50 litres.△这屋子能坐下10人。¦The room can seat ten people.△口袋太小，装不下这么多米。¦The sack is too small to hold so much rice.
