下边◆◆xiàbian◆名§§§lower place△大桥下边¦under/beneath the bridge△垫子/皮肤下边¦underneath the mattress/skin△图表/横线下边¦below the chart/line△眼睛下边¦below/under/beneath one's eyes△站在树下边¦stand under a tree△严肃的外表下边¦underneath one's severe manner△最下边一个抽屉/一张牌¦bottom drawer/card△把日期写在地址下边。¦Write the date underneath the address.△管子漏水，我们给下边放了只桶接水。¦The pipe was leaking, so we put a bucket underneath to catch the water.△他们从山上眺望着下边的山谷。¦They looked from the mountain into the valley far below.△我在外衣下边穿了件毛衣。¦I'm wearing a sweater under my coat.△医生给她补了下边的两颗牙。¦The dentist filled the cavities in two of her lower teeth.△有人正从下边朝上推井盖。¦Someone was pushing the manhole lid up from underneath.▷名§§§next△下边该谁了？¦Who is the next?△下边轮到你了。¦It's your turn next.△下边请魏先生讲话。¦Now I give you Mr Wei.▷名§§§lower level; subordinate△了解下边的情况¦find out how things are at the lower level△倾听下边的意见¦listen attentively to the views of one's subordinates; listen to the opinions from the grass roots
下降◆◆xiàjiàng◆动§§§descend; go/come down; drop; fall; decline△环比下降¦to fall month on month△视力下降¦someone's eyesight is getting bad/degrading; loss of vision△数量/质量下降¦fall in quantity/quality△生活水平下降¦standard of living declines; have a lower standard of living; become worse off△同比下降¦to drop by...from last year's same period/from the same period a year earlier△成本下降了4%。¦The cost was reduced by four per cent.△地下水位在下降。¦The underground water table is going down.△气温突然下降。¦The temperature took a sudden drop.△我的听力在下降。¦My hearing is weakening.△温度下降了10摄氏度。¦The temperature fell by 10°C.△物价在稳步下降。¦Prices have been going down steadily.△消费物价现在处于下降通道。¦Consumer prices are now on the downward track. / Consumer prices are now on the way down.△销售量下降了。¦Sales have dropped off.△人口的出生率几年来一直在下降。¦The birthrate has been declining for several years.△由于丑闻，她的社会地位下降了。¦Her social standing has been lowered because of the scandal.△他的声望已下降。¦His reputation has sunk/dropped.
