nswered with 'Yes' or 'No']△你吃点儿不吃？¦Do you want to eat something?△他走不走？¦Is he leaving?△我漂亮不漂亮？¦Am I beautiful?▷副§§§[used correlatively with 就 to indicate alteration] if not...(then); either...or...△不洗手就不许你吃晚饭。¦There's no dinner for you if you don't wash your hands.△他不生气就不抽烟。¦He never smokes unless he is angry.△他不是上课就是在写论文。¦He is either having class or writing his thesis.▷副§§方§[only used in some polite formulae] don't; needn't△“非常感谢!” “不谢。”¦'Thank you very much.' 'Don't mention it. / You're welcome.'△“我也去吗？” “不用了。”¦'Shall I go as well?' 'No, don't bother.'
