压◆◆yā◆动§§§press; hold/push/weigh down△把子弹压进弹匣¦press the cartridges into the magazine△用石子把塑料纸压住¦hold the plastic sheeting down with some stones△用手指压住血管止血¦constrict a blood vessel with fingers to stop bleeding△累累的果实压弯了树枝。¦The branches were bowed by/under the weight of fruit hanging in clusters.△你的胳膊压着孩子了。¦You're resting your arm on the baby.△我的提包压不得。¦My bag won't stand much weight.△工作压得我们透不过气来。¦We are swamped with work.△责任重重地压在他的身上。¦His responsibilities pressed heavily upon him.△这任务是从上面压下来的。¦The task is imposed from above.▷动§§§cover; envelop△暮色压下来了。¦Twilight is enshrouding the earth.△我有点冷，给我再压床被子。¦I'm feeling a bit cold. Pull another quilt over me.▷动§§§suppress; quell; subdue△树正气，压邪气¦encourage healthy trends and check unhealthy ones△以势压人¦overwhelm people with one's power△压而不服。¦Coercion will never result in convincing people.△别拿大帽子压我。¦Don't intimidate me by unwarranted charges.△合理的要求被压下去了。¦Reasonable demands have been suppressed/killed.△困难压不倒我们。¦No difficulties can overwhelm/subdue us. / We will not collapse under the pressure of the difficulties.△他又用顶头上司的意见来压我了。¦He is again trying to coerce me into submission with the proposals of our immediate superior.▷动§§§control; restrain; keep calm; calm down△压着怒火¦hold one's anger in leash; control/leash/subdue one's anger; hold back one's rage△把嗓门压得很低¦lower one's voice to a hiss△吃点药压压咳嗽。¦Take some medicine to ease the cough.△一提起这事，我就压不住心头的激动。¦I can't restrain my excitement whenever this is mentioned.△这个形势下只有你能压住阵脚。¦Only you can control the situation now.▷动§§§prevail/win over; outdo; conquer△在上半场比赛中，我们在比分上一直压着对方。¦Throughout the first half of the game, our team was ahead of our opponents in scores.▷动§§§approach; draw near; gain on; close in on△敌军向我们的阵地压过来了。¦The enemy troop was bearing down on our position.△太阳压树梢了。¦The setting sun is touching the treetops.△乌云从西边压过来了。¦A mass of dark clouds are converging quickly above us from the west.▷动§§§lay aside; pigeonhole; shelve△货压在仓库里。¦The goods have piled up in stock.△这份报告被压了半年。¦This report